DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260517T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260517T120000
SUMMARY:LFS Coffee & Convo  
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThe Coffee and Convo meetup is 
 always on the 3rd Sunday of the Month at 9am.\n\nWe will meet at Centervil
 le Diner\, 100 S. Centerville Rd.\n\nMeet up with fellow freethinkers to t
 alk\, eat or just have a warm or cold beverage of your choice. This is usu
 ally a small intimate meeting. It's about casual conversation and getting 
 to know your fellow freethinkers.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 308585168/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20250621T185248Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250621T185248Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_314741623@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260512T035835Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T200000
SUMMARY:PA Primary Election Day!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nTuesday\, May 19th is Pensylvan
 ia's Primary Election day! Last day to register to vote ahead of this prim
 ary election was May 4th\, 2026\, so sorry for my late notification! Make 
 sure you cast your vote this primary\, and again in the General Election o
 n November 3rd 2026!\n\nhttps://www.pa.gov/agencies/vote/elections/upcomin
 g-elections.html\n\nThe Lancaster Freethought Society encourages considera
 tion of the values of Free-Thought and Secularism when evaluating policies
 \, candidates\, and political parties.\n\nComment below and let us know th
 at you voted\, and please tell us what criteria guide you in making your s
 elections!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314741623/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260511T234239Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260511T234239Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_314461070@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260512T035835Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T210000
SUMMARY:Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at 
 Indian Curry Lounge with us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday May 23rd!\n\nYou may remem
 ber this Indian restaurant location was previously known as Namaste\, and 
 before that Tulsi. It is built into the first floor of the motel building\
 , it is two doors down from El Serranos\, where we meet for our other mont
 hly evening meeting!\n\nIndian Curry Lounge\n2101 Columbia Avenue\nLancast
 er PA 17603
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314461070/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260424T180130Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T180130Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_314168043@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260512T035835Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T210000
SUMMARY:May Movie Night!  
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe have a lot of great movies f
 or this month! We showed Wicked pt 1 earlier this year\, and can get aroun
 d to the sequel\, and/or have fun with less serious than usual films! Opti
 ons include:\n\nWicked for Good (pt 2)\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/
 watch?v=R2Xubj7lazE\n\nDogma\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-8
 UW-O-rhv0\n\nVelocipastor\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JppwK
 pfOgyo\n\nMarjoe\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ui7Pz4blum0\n\
 nAnd many\, many more! Bring your own film selections and we may decide to
  show them!\n\nAdmission is Free! Bring as many family members and friends
  as you would like! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out 
 and share your thoughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, plea
 se do bring more to share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if y
 ou partake in delivered food!\n\nSaturday\, May 30th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nO
 ther Room Theater\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay sta
 rting the movie to give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\,
  please try to arrive before then if you do not want to miss any of the mo
 vie.\n\nPICTURED below is the main entrance\, the event space is right up 
 the stairs. On street parking should be available\, several public parking
  lots such as behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314168043/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260407T185527Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260407T185527Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_308585170@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260512T035835Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260603T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260603T210000
SUMMARY:LFS Monthly Discussion - El Serrano's
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nCome joins us for intelligent d
 iscussion and freethinking fun at our monthly meeting. Lancaster Freethoug
 ht Society is a community for Freethinkers\, Atheists\, Agnostics\, Humani
 sts\, Non-believers\, Skeptics\, and those who are simply curious. There i
 s no fee to attend our meetings which range from topical subjects of inter
 est to freethinkers such as Church/State Separation\, as well as subjects 
 such as science\, philosophy\, ethics\, counter-apologetics\, and psycholo
 gy. All are welcome to attend no matter what your beliefs may be but prose
 lytizing is not allowed. Bring your articles\, news\, jokes\, gripes\, que
 stions\, ideas\, topics\, or anything else you would like to discuss with 
 the rest of the group.\n\nHope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 308585170/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20250621T185256Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250621T185256Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
